{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03732","headline":"奉和幸三会寺应制 · 李峤","name":"奉和幸三会寺应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故台苍颉里，新邑紫泉居。\n岁在开金寺，时来降玉舆。\n龙形虽近刹，鸟迹尚留书。\n竹是蒸青外，池仍点墨余。\n天文光圣草，宝思合真如。\n谬奉千龄日，欣陪十地初。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李峤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03732.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03732","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}